WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.650
This bridge is a row of triangles, two metres wide.

2
00:00:04.579 --> 00:00:06.704
Four panels of triangles.

3
00:00:09.452 --> 00:00:12.802
The top pushes; the deck and the diagonals pull.

4
00:00:15.407 --> 00:00:18.532
It holds until about fourteen hundred newtons.
